{"type":"message","id":"fac0e495","parentId":"1d9fc2be","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:14:56.763Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are performing quantity takeoff for the HHC Bellevue Hospital Ambulance Drop Off project — BATCH 3: MEP, Specialties & General items.\n\n**Project:** /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/\n\n**YOUR ITEMS (from bid_breakdown.json):**\n- 02-01: Asbestos Abatement (LS)\n- 02-02: Selective Demolition - Interior (LS)\n- 02-03: Site Demolition (LS)\n- 10-01: Visual Display Boards (EA)\n- 10-02: Signage (LS)\n- 10-03: Toilet Compartments (EA)\n- 10-04: Toilet Accessories (LS)\n- 10-05: Fire Extinguishers (EA)\n- 11-01: Security Equipment (LS)\n- 11-02: Weapon Detection System (LS)\n- 11-03: Medical Equipment (LS)\n- 11-04: Decontamination Equipment (LS)\n- 13-01: Special Construction (LS) — flood barriers, ballistic panels\n- 14-01: Conveying Equipment (LS)\n- 21-01: Fire Sprinkler System (LS)\n- 22-01: Plumbing Piping (LS)\n- 22-02: Plumbing Fixtures (EA)\n- 23-01: HVAC Ductwork (LS)\n- 23-02: HVAC Equipment (LS)\n- 23-03: Controls (LS)\n- 25-01: Building Automation (LS)\n- 26-01: Electrical Service (LS)\n- 26-02: Lighting (LS)\n- 26-03: Power Distribution (LS)\n- 27-01: Data/Telecom (LS)\n- 28-01: Fire Alarm (LS)\n- 28-02: Security Systems (LS)\n\n**KEY SHEETS TO ANALYZE (use image tool):**\n- drawings/pages/page_008.png (A-101 Construction Plan) — room layout for fixture counts\n- drawings/pages/page_025.png (AD-101 Demo Plans) — demo scope extent\n- drawings/pages/page_032.png (E-101 Electrical Power) — outlet/panel counts\n- drawings/pages/page_034.png (E-201 Lighting) — fixture counts\n- drawings/pages/page_036.png (E-301 Panel Schedules) — panel data\n- drawings/pages/page_030.png (E-002 Light Fixture Schedule) — fixture types/quantities\n\nAlso read:\n- synthesis/mep_coordination_review.json — MEP equipment list\n- synthesis/demo_scope.json — demo scope\n- synthesis/door_schedule_complete.json — for ballistic panel info\n- specs/specs_summary.json — spec requirements\n- drawings/text/ for text layers of relevant sheets\n\n**METHODOLOGY:**\nFor each item:\n- Quantity with unit (many are LS — still describe scope extent)\n- Calculation method or scope description\n- Confidence level (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\n- Notes/assumptions\n\n**CRITICAL:**\n- For LS items: describe what's included so it can be priced\n- For plumbing fixtures: count from floor plan\n- For lighting: count fixture types from E-201 and fixture schedule\n- For demo: reference demo_scope.json for extent\n- Count fire extinguishers from floor plan\n- WRITE RESULTS IMMEDIATELY to synthesis/takeoff_batch3_mep_specialties.json — do not wait\n\nSave output to synthesis/takeoff_batch3_mep_specialties.json"}],"timestamp":1770052496762}}
