{"type":"message","id":"9aea885c","parentId":"8492c221","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:18:25.659Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:38","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is **not** sheet A-101 First Floor Plan. This is sheet **A-200.00** — an **Exterior Components and Building Enclosure Systems** sheet showing building exterior elevations/axonometric views and wall assembly details for the ED Ambulance Bay Addition at H+H Bellevue.\n\nThis sheet contains:\n- Axon views of the building interior and exterior\n- A Building Enclosure System schedule (wall types BES-01 through BES-21)\n- Detail drawings of insulated exterior sliding door/storefront and non-insulated interior sliding door/storefront\n\n**There are no plumbing fixtures, fire extinguisher cabinets, toilet compartments, signage symbols, security equipment, or fire alarm devices shown on this sheet.** All requested counts are **zero** — this is an exterior envelope/enclosure detail sheet, not a floor plan."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_011.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052705654}}
{"type":"message","id":"03f084e1","parentId":"9aea885c","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:18:33.236Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:39","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This appears to be a **Fire Alarm notes/cover sheet** (sheet FA-000), not an actual floor plan showing device locations. It contains general notes, submittal notes, and project information for the \"ED Ambulance Bay Addition\" project at H+H Bellevue, but **no fire alarm device symbols or floor plan layouts are shown**.\n\nTherefore, I **cannot count or locate any specific devices** from this sheet, as it does not depict:\n\n1. **Smoke detectors** – 0 shown\n2. **Heat detectors** – 0 shown\n3. **Pull stations** – 0 shown\n4. **Fire alarm horns/strobes** – 0 shown\n5. **Fire alarm control panels** – 0 shown\n\nThe actual device counts and locations would be on the accompanying floor plan sheets (likely labeled FA-100, FA-101, etc.). If you can provide those sheets, I can perform the count."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_042.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052713229}}
{"type":"message","id":"61b51eb7","parentId":"03f084e1","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:18:39.583Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:40","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is **not a plumbing plan** — it is sheet **M-301.00**, titled \"Mechanical Details (1 of 9)\" for the ED Ambulance Bay Addition project. It contains HVAC/mechanical details such as ductwork interpretation, volume control dampers, duct connection details, turning vanes, pipe insulation schedules, and drain pan details.\n\n**There are no plumbing fixtures** (toilets, sinks, floor drains, hose bibbs, etc.) shown on this sheet."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_051.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052719577}}
